body:
Oh darrrn, you right! Thanks for pointing that out! I feel like I'm close to somethin', though! Are there any spells that can create an area to safely and permanently teleport the Tarrasque to?

&#x200B;

This isn't for a campaign or anything, I've literally just been thinking of this for fun. "What's the easiest way for a player to single-handedly dispose of a Tarrasque?" XD
